/*
 * utils — helper utilities for manipulating diagnostic trees.
 *
 * This module provides small, focused helpers used by the error subsystem.
 * In particular, it defines `flatten`, a function that normalizes nested
 * diagnostic lists into a flat sequence of ErrorMsg nodes.
 *
 * Flattening is used throughout the compiler to:
 *   - eliminate ErrorMsg::list wrappers,
 *   - deduplicate diagnostics by ID,
 *   - optionally sort diagnostics by source location,
 *   - preserve the original order when sorting is disabled.
 *
 * This ensures that diagnostic trees remain stable, predictable, and free of
 * redundant list nesting, regardless of how notes are constructed.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::utils
 * @File: ymirc/errors/utils.yr
 * @Author(s):
